<view class="page"><view class="row between"><text class="brand">↗ 华立转角</text><text class="pill">广州校区</text></view><view class="notice">本地模拟交易 · 不扣真实款项</view><view class="hero"><view class="muted">计算机工程学院试点</view><view class="hero-title">闲置转个弯，<br/>好物<text>再出发。</text></view><view class="muted">闲置有去处，同学有照应。</view></view><form bindsubmit="search" class="row search"><input name="q" placeholder="搜索书名、ISBN、球拍…"/><button size="mini" form-type="submit">搜索</button></form><view class="tabs"><button data-id="" bindtap="category">全部</button><button data-id="books" bindtap="category">二手书</button><button data-id="living" bindtap="category">宿舍生活</button><button data-id="sports" bindtap="category">运动闲置</button></view><view class="grid"><view class="card" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image wx:if="{{item.isPhoto}}" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="cover">{{item.title}}<text class="muted">演示封面</text></view><view class="card-content"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.edition || item.condition}}</view><view class="price">自提 ¥{{item.priceText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.delivery==='both'?'送货 ¥'+item.delivered:item.delivery==='delivery'?'仅送货':'仅自提'}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.region}} · {{item.nickname}}</view></view></view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!products.length}}">还没有匹配商品，欢迎发布第一件好物。</view></view><view class="nav"><button data-tab="community" bindtap="nav">社区</button><button data-tab="cart" bindtap="nav">清单</button><button class="primary" data-tab="publish" bindtap="nav">＋发布</button><button data-tab="messages" bindtap="nav">消息</button><button data-tab="me" bindtap="nav">我的</button></view>
